# Optional: terminate TLS with Caddy in front of the gateway HTTP port.
# Needs a public domain and port 80/443 open. The current demo ECS has neither.
#
#   caddy run --config Caddyfile
#
# Replace example.com with a real domain you control. Do not invent one.

